  "full_text": "So, let's play some Primus, eh? I like that. Well, not really, anyway. WK. Hey, uh, I could probably... No, I can't really... I can't even play that stuff, obviously. Let's see. That's my own. My puck gets tired. Let's see what you guys think. Let's see what you saw. A little drummer boy, eh? The kings like drums, apparently. Drums are associated with war. And it shall come to pass in the same time when Gog came against the land of Israel, that the Lord said, My fury shall come in my face, for in my jealousy and in the fire of my wrath I have spoken. Surely in that day there shall be great shaking in the land of Israel, so that fishes of the sea, and fowls of heaven, and beasts of the field, and all creeping things that creep on the earth, and all men that are on the face of the earth, shall shake at my presence, and the mountains shall be thrown down, and the steep places shall fall. Every wall shall fall to the ground. For I will call my sword against him throughout all my mountains, saith the Lord. Every man's sword shall be at his brother's. And I will keep against him with pestilence his foot. And rain upon him, and upon his bands, and upon many people that are with him. And overflowing rain, great hailstones, fire, and brimstone. Thus I will magnify myself, and sanctify myself. I will be known in the eyes of many nations, and they shall know that I am the Lord.",
